      "content": "hey, i had a bit of a trip and fell on my way to work earlier. nothing much happened, no blood or anything but im feeling kinda lightheaded and the screen on my phone is making my eyes feel really sensitive/stinging. any natural ways to fix the dizziness so i can just get back to work? i dont really want to spend my afternoon in a doctors office if i can avoid it.",
