      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i already tried some breathing and it didn't really do much. the light sensitivity is still pretty annoying though. i feel like it's just from the shock of falling or maybe i'm just dehydrated. should i try taking something like a high dose of magnesium or maybe some ginger shots to help settle myself? i just need to get through the rest of my shift.",
